<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Tekala shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Tekala shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The shares of Tekala Corp Bhd were suspended from trading on Wednesday on a request from the company, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange (KLSE) said.</p>
<p>He said the company had requested the suspension pending an announcement.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>Tekala, based at Tawau in the Borneo state of Sabah, is involved in the timber business.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
